{"version": 3, "term": {"cols": 100, "rows": 30}, "timestamp": 1786299963, "title": "CoolERP \u2014 an AI agent operating a double-entry ledger over MCP"}
[0.35, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[1.323, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33mCoolERP \u2014 an AI agent operating a double-entry ledger over MCP\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.306, "o", "\u001b[2mEight typed tools. The engine tells the agent what is legal; the database\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.284, "o", "\u001b[2mrefuses anything that would unbalance the books. No screen-scraping.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.225, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m1. Start an order-to-cash process\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.616, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 start_process\u001b[0m {\"process\":\"order_to_cash\",\"reference\":\"SO-202605\",\"context\":{}}\r\n"]
[7.553, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32minquiry\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n"]
[9.503, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m2. Ask the engine what is legal from here\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.48, "o", "\u001b[2mThis is the whole point: the agent does not guess and get rejected.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.827, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 get_process_instance\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6}\r\n"]
[12.817, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32minquiry\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n    - \u001b[1mconfirm_order       \u001b[0m -> so_open         \r\n"]
[14.785, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m3. Try an ILLEGAL move \u2014 post the invoice before shipping\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.769, "o", "\u001b[2mA chat-bot-on-an-ERP would attempt this. The engine refuses, and says why.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.177, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 advance_process\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6,\"capability\":\"post_invoice\",\"context_patch\":{},\"amounts\":{}}\r\n"]
[18.63, "o", "\u001b[1;31m  x refused:\u001b[0m VALIDATION: no transition from 'inquiry' with capability 'post_invoice'. Available from 'inquiry': confirm_order -> so_open\r\n"]
[20.568, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m4. Walk the legal path instead\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.977, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 advance_process\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6,\"capability\":\"confirm_order\",\"context_patch\":{},\"amounts\":{}}\r\n"]
[22.914, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32mso_open\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n"]
[24.326, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 advance_process\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6,\"capability\":\"run_credit_check\",\"context_patch\":{},\"amounts\":{}}\r\n"]
[25.268, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32mcredit_check\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n"]
[26.684, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 advance_process\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6,\"capability\":\"release_credit_hold\",\"context_patch\":{},\"amounts\":{}}\r\n"]
[27.623, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32mconfirmed\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n"]
[29.037, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 advance_process\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6,\"capability\":\"allocate_inventory\",\"context_patch\":{},\"amounts\":{}}\r\n"]
[29.978, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32mfulfillment\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n"]
[31.931, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m5. The next step posts to the general ledger\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.278, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 get_process_instance\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6}\r\n"]
[34.309, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32mfulfillment\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n    - \u001b[1mdeliver             \u001b[0m -> shipped            \u001b[35m[posts: DR cost_of_goods_sold]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[35.283, "o", "\u001b[2mThe [posts \u2026] annotation comes from the YAML, not from the model.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.259, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m6. Deliver \u2014 this writes a real journal entry (COGS / inventory)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[38.678, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u2192 advance_process\u001b[0m {\"instance_id\":6,\"capability\":\"deliver\",\"context_patch\":{},\"amounts\":{\"amount\":250000}}\r\n"]
[39.615, "o", "  state: \u001b[1;32mshipped\u001b[0m   (instance 6)\r\n"]
[41.562, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m7. The books, straight from the ledger\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[43.888, "o", " code |        name         | currency | debits_cents | credits_cents \r\n------+---------------------+----------+--------------+---------------\r\n 1000 | Cash                | EUR      |     50950000 |             0\r\n 1100 | Accounts Receivable | EUR      |      1200000 |        700000\r\n 1200 | Inventory           | EUR      |            0 |       1000000\r\n 2100 | Tax Payable         | EUR      |            0 |        200000\r\n 3000 | Owner Equity        | EUR      |            0 |      50000000\r\n 4000 | Sales Revenue       | EUR      |            0 |       1250000\r\n 5000 | COGS                | EUR      |      1000000 |             0\r\n(7 rows)\r\n\r\n"]
[44.841, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33mEvery step above is append-only and audited.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[45.825, "o", "\u001b[2mThe balance invariant is enforced by database triggers \u2014 not by the agent,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[46.812, "o", "\u001b[2mand not by the API layer. The LLM proposes; the deterministic core disposes.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.713, "x", "0"]
[50.213, "o", "\r\n"]
